{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_189_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_189","textTraditional":"一、九年。春，叔弓會楚子于陳。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_189_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_189","textTraditional":"二、許遷于夷。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_189_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_189","textTraditional":"三、夏四月，陳火。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_189_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_189","textTraditional":"陳已滅矣，其言陳火何？存陳也，曰存陳悕矣！曷為存陳？滅人之國，執人之罪人，殺人之賊，葬人之君，若是則陳存悕矣！","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_189_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_189","textTraditional":"四、秋，仲孫貜如齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_189_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_189","textTraditional":"五、冬，築郎囿。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}